{"4406480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FLOW", "steam_appid": 4406480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406480/extras/86370fd80053ca66562155021a61c705.poster.avif?t=1774394671\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406480/extras/86370fd80053ca66562155021a61c705.webm?t=1774394671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4406480/extras/86370fd80053ca66562155021a61c705.mp4?t=1774394671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are one of the few survivors left after a devastating apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lost in a dark and mysterious forest, you must fight for your life in a world filled with zombies and terrifying mutants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore dangerous lands, build shelters, and do everything you can to survive in this exciting first-person survival simulator, where every night could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut down trees, gather resources, and build campfires to stay warm and survive. Hunt and find food to stay fed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build anything from small shelters to massive fortified bases by the ocean. Set up traps and defenses to secure your perimeter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore and build during the day, and defend your base at night. Craft weapons and tools, hide in the dark, or face your enemies head-on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight zombies and deadly monsters using bows, sniper rifles, and other weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose your survival style:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >